the best review of "Cats."

00:08:09.688 --> 00:08:14.326
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:14.326 --> 00:08:15.661
Next up is #whitenoise.

00:08:15.661 --> 00:08:18.163
You may think it's trending
because Amazon has a deal

00:08:18.163 --> 00:08:20.166
on white noise machines.

00:08:20.166 --> 00:08:21.333
but #whitenoise
is actually trending

00:08:21.333 --> 00:08:22.601
because it's how
most people describe

00:08:22.601 --> 00:08:23.902
last night's Democratic debate.

00:08:23.902 --> 00:08:25.637
[ Laughter, ohhing ]

00:08:25.637 --> 00:08:27.339
Up next is the word #goat.

00:08:27.339 --> 00:08:29.174
It could be trending
'cause Ken Jennings

00:08:29.174 --> 00:08:31.810
was named "Jeopardy!'s"
Greatest of All Time.

00:08:31.810 --> 00:08:34.247
But goat is actually trending
'cause the main ingredient

00:08:34.247 --> 00:08:36.381
in Arby's Meat Supreme
Stacked Sandwich.

00:08:36.381 --> 00:08:38.384
[ Ohhing ]

00:08:38.384 --> 00:08:40.686
[ Laughter ]

00:08:40.686 --> 00:08:42.154
That's not a real sandwich.
Not a real sandwich.

00:08:42.154 --> 00:08:43.689
-That's not real. Joke.
-I made it up.

00:08:43.689 --> 00:08:45.691
Next up, there's #trex.

00:08:45.691 --> 00:08:47.860
It should be trending
'cause the band T. Rex

00:08:47.860 --> 00:08:50.229
is getting inducted into the
Rock and Roll Hall of Fame.

00:08:50.229 --> 00:08:51.897
But #trex is actually
trending 'cause

00:08:51.897 --> 00:08:53.532
Bernie sanders talked
about his first pet.

00:08:53.532 --> 00:08:57.369
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:57.369 --> 00:09:00.138
And, finally, there's the
#highclass.

00:09:00.138 --> 00:09:01.507
You may think
it's trending 'cause

00:09:01.507 --> 00:09:04.042
